    "title": "Wilton-Lyndeborough girls track team shines with Sydney Beam's victories",
    "text": "Sydney Beam won the 800- and 1,600-meter races to lead the Wilton-Lyndeborough girls track and field team to a third-place finish with 54 points.\nBeam won the 1,600 in 6 minutes, 3.06 seconds and the 800 in 2:49.11. Alyvia Benson placed second in the 200 in 29.45 seconds, and Paisley Silva was second in the 800 in 2:49.11.\n“The Lady Warriors are really demonstrating why they are driving to be the best team in Division III track and field,” said coach Howard Ray.",
